OL,3,GNEWSASevere weather warning as island
OL,4,Abraces for Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople on Isle of Man have been warned
OL,7,Fto brace for severe gales of up to
OL,8,F70mph with a risk or injury and damage
OL,9,Fto property as Storm Boelo reaches it
OL,10,Fheight.
OL,12,FTwo amber weather warnings has been
OL,13,Fissued by the island's Met Office,
OL,14,Fincluding warnings of large waves
OL,15,Fcrashing over coastal roads.
OL,17,FThe storm is expected to be at its
OL,18,Fworst from early evening on Saturday
OL,19,Funtil Sunday afternoon.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,451,445,260,140,0,100
